{07 14 00}I received a letter from 
the {ff 00 00 02}Happy Room Academy{ff 00 00 00},
and guess what?! {ff 00 00 02}
{ff 00 00 00}{07 0a 00}It said I earned {ff 00 00 02}{04 0f 00}
{ff 00 00 00}points! {01 00 00 05 00}My keen sense of
style has paid off again!
{07 00 00}I wonder if it's because I{01 00 00 05 00} 
tried to use the same color
when decorating??

